<title>USA: Louis Dreyfus sells West Texas interests.</title>
<headline>Louis Dreyfus sells West Texas interests.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY, Okla. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Louis Dreyfus Natural Gas Corp said Thursday it has agreed to sell its interest in certain non-core oil properties in the Levelland Field of West Texas to Santa Fe Energy Resources Inc.</p>
<p>The company said expects to recognize a $9 million gain upon closing, which is to be in early January.</p>
<p>The company also said it has bought a $16 million, 75-mile pipeline, associated compressors and transportation contracts in its Sonora Field.</p>
</text>
